{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show 8 feels like a useful next addition because a household screen and Alexa controls would complement my Fire TV devices; I prefer its larger screen over buying the Show 5 or a separate speaker.",
    "The smart plug offers a simple use with a compatible lamp, while the memory card could support my recent camcorder purchase if its format and recording capabilities fit. Both connect to practical uses I can identify."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another HD Fire TV Stick adds little because I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; familiarity does not make a redundant device useful.",
    "The charging cables, tablet, sport earbuds, and colored-lighting bundle do not address a current need. Owning home electronics does not mean I am looking for every kind of electronic accessory."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in a broad range of Amazon devices, although I choose devices for the specific functions they add.",
    "My electronics purchases seem to have been treated as a general appetite for gadgets, without enough attention to whether I have a use for each one."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: a useful addition should bring a new capability, and an HD streaming stick offers little alongside my existing 4K setup.",
    "Accessory compatibility and choosing between overlapping devices matter. I would verify storage requirements for my camcorder and choose one suitable Alexa display rather than buy several similar devices."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in home viewing and connected devices, but overlook whether each purchase adds a useful, compatible capability to what I already own."
}"}
